From 33c51965005e986501ab7e1d74a126a36ffde0b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
by: triplecN
Subject: [PATCH 11/20] re-anchor ticket mining, relay rate limit, CMake OFF
 build

generateperticket mines in 1024-nonce slices anchored to the current tip,
so a ticket found after a long search is still valid. The perticket rate
limiter no longer charges for tickets the node already has, randomx is
linked in both CACHECOIN_RANDOMX configurations, and a failed history read
is no longer cached.
---
